Subject: [RFC] drm/apple: keep AV open state with the current service

A native HDMI video teardown can be followed by a replacement audio
service without an audio teardown callback. Clear stale open state on
replacement and ignore callbacks from superseded services. Validate the
captured generation after OPEN, and serialize OPEN/CLOSE without
blocking the AFK receive worker.

Local candidate: behavior harness and module build passed; two hardware
wake cycles restored ALSA HDMI availability. Streaming is not yet validated. This does not fix the delayed firmware video-interface restart
or the independent AFK slot-retirement limitation.

---

